<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">Itsaangi (TSA) NT en Kitsaangi</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Te</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a myole wa Pahuli huli bisu Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a myole wa Pahuli huli bisu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a myole wa Pahuli huli bisu Tesalonika, li mu ufutahala musamu wu nde haasalili hutso muhanda a tsomi. Bu taangu yili mu uvyoho, ni buuna kaka Bamukristo bali mu unyongo bunubu: <char style="em">Yisu Kristo a halengeyafutaha ve. </char> Hu musyenge a Tesalonika, bakima bali mu uleele ti ilumbu hya Pfumu hyamiikwaya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:2">2.2</ref></char>). Bakima bali mu ubisa usala (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:6-12">3.6-12</ref></char>). Bo bali mu utsima ti isalu a hisaali na tsalu ve, mu tooni ati nziili a Pfumu yaaka bebele.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu muhanda mo wunuwu, Pahuli li mu uyelese ndongisili a nde. Imiinu mu Kristo a hili mu ufwinzala bukulu bwosi bwa baatu ve. Imiinu mu Kristo a hili kaka manili mapasi ma ŋa toto ve. Ilumbu hi Yisu huuyafutaha, nde sa asukasa bubi ŋa toto (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:5-9">1.5-9</ref></char>). Ka ŋaniiŋa, bubi buli mu usala ŋa toto mu tswehi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-12">2.1-12</ref></char>). Pahuli li mu uteele bubi, we muutu «Nga bubi». Ni matwala ma mali mu upfuuta mifudi mimibi myosi. Hu li na isiha imosi hi hili mu utsikamasa matwala mo maana, mu uvelesinzamonehele. Mbadi ŋa matwala musinzamonehele, we bu mo mali, sa basukasa mo. Ka taangu mo yiina, a yatoodi kini ve. Yiniiyi ni mbindulili: <char style="em">ŋa Yisu huuyafutaha we Pfumu a toto</char>, baatu buumono buni bubi bu li. Mono buni matwala ma bubi muuyasuka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda mo wunuwu li mu uvondo Bamukristo mu uveletsima ti, bo baamiito ŋa iteesi. Tso bu bo bali mu ukeele nzili a Pfumu, bo baafwana ubaasala na ubaakuhasa bibiinda bya bo pasi ilumbu mu tsi.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Me Pahuli, Silaasi na Timoteho, lili mu ubila libundu la bisu Tesalonika, la Nzambi Taata a bisu na Pfumu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Nyaha Nzambi Taata a bisu na Pfumu Yisu Kristo, bava benu hyese na hyenze.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfumu sa aya mu utsundasa baatu ŋa tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Baana bangu, bisu lafwana ubafutala matondo taangu yoosi huli Nzambi, mu tooni a benu. Hwafwana huli bisu mu usa buuna, mu umono buni imiinu hya benu hili mu ukula. Bisu lili mu umono kaka buni litondo li benu lili mu umweese mu bana, lili mu ukula. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ni mu buuna, bisu lili na nyeme mu uyambila mu benu mutso mabundu ma Nzambi. Mu tooni ati benu laateleme mu imiinu, tso bu benu lili mu ubwana mbingisili na mapasi.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ŋaniiŋa huli mu umweese huli baatu boosi iliimbu hya ti, tsundusu a Nzambi yili yi butsiitsa. Mapasi ma benu lili mu ukunda, mali mu uva benu muswa mu umonehele ba bakuha mu ukoto mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi. Ipfumu hi benu lili mu umono mapasi mu hyo. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Mu mbuli, Nzambi li wu akuha. Nde ufutala munyongi huli baa bubaanyongese benu. <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Huli benu ba bali mu unyongese, Nzambi sa ava benu pumiili itwadi na bisu. Sa huba buuna, ŋa Yisu uyamonehele hu mayulu na bapofi ba nde baa nga matwala. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Nde sa aya hutso a ludi la mbaahu, mu usyembe ba baaveleyaba Nzambi na ba baavelesingala Musamu wu Mubwe wa Pfumu a bisu Yisu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Bo sa bayaka tsyembili ya pasi, ni lipfu li bilima na bilima. Bo a buumono hiinzi hya Pfumu na muyusu wu mifudi mya nde ve. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Maana sa mavangama ŋa nde huya mu uyaka muyusu ŋa hati la ba nde boosi. Ba bali mu usa imiinu mu nde, sa baba hutso a kimuhili na minywa bwasi. Benu sa liba ŋa hati la bo, mu tooni ati benu laasa imiinu mu ndongisili a bisu.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Ni mu buuna, bisu libaasambila taangu yoosi mu benu. Bisu libaavondo huli Nzambi a bisu mu ukitusa benu ba baakuha, mu teelili yi benu laayaka. Bisu lili mu uvondo ti, mu matwala ma nde, nde akumbasa benu mu ukuhasa peyu a benu mu uvanga ma mabwe, mana imiinu hya benu himonehele mu mavaanga. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Buuna, nduhi a Pfumu a bisu Yisu sa bayusa mu tooni a benu. Na sa bayuusa benu mu tooni a nde. Hiina sa hiba iliimbu hya hyese hya Nzambi a bisu na Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tswamina nziili a Pfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Mu ma mali mu utala nziili a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, na kuukimini a bisu ŋa pedu a nde, bisu livondi benu dyaambu limosi, baana ba ngu. <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />A lilenge mu uba na boomo, buuve mu uba matsimi helini-helini ve, tso muutu yayabisa benu ti ilumbu hya nziili a Pfumu himiito. A liyuhala nde ve, tso baaleele ti mbihulili, buuve ti maluumbi, buuve ti muhanda miimata huli bisu. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Likele muutu a hasoho benu we bu nde atoondi ve. Mu tooni ati, ilumbu mo hiina a hyuya tswamina baatu bateleme mu utuna Nzambi ve. Na tswamina bubi bumonehele mu iteesi hya muutu nga bukanyi, wu amiidunga. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Muboho mo wunuuwu, wu unangimana pasi baatu bubaasambila, bi bubaamono ti bili bya ngidi. Nde sa anangimana biina byosi na sa ayakoto natee mu nzo a Nzambi, na utsahala muuna na ubaatuka tulu, ti nde ni Nzambi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan 11.36</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Ezk 28.2</ref></char></note><verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Benu a lili mu uyibwala moonyi ti me anzabisi benu lo ŋa me amba kini na benu ve? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Ka benu liyaabi ti isiha himosi hyakanga muutu mo nga bukanyi, mana nde amonehele ndulu mu taangu yi Nzambi haakese. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Mu tooni ati, matwala ma nga bukanyi, mamiitswiha mu tswehi. Hwamiisaala ndulu aka ti, wu akaanga matwala mo maana, uhwada mu ukaanga mo natee taangu yi nde hudimbala. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Buuna, nga bukanyi sa amonehele. Pfumu Yisu sa aduba nde mu mupu wu upala mu munywa nde, na nde sa ahesolo nde mu matwala ma nziili a nde. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Nga bukanyi mo wunuwu, sa aya na matwala ma Saatana. Nde sa avanga bipadi bya pila mu pila, biliimbu bya kimuhili, na bimangu bya soho. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Nde usalila bubi bwa pila mu pila, mu usoho boosi ba buudunga. Bo buudunga mu tooni ati, bo a baayaka tso utondo imbuli hi hyuyobolo bo ve. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Buuna Nzambi sa atsindaha bo matwala ma udunga, mana bo basa hiitu mu mapfuta. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Ni mu buuna, baatu boosi ba baavelisa hiitu mu imbuli, ka baamoni kinya na baakangimi mu mavaanga ma mabi, sa batsundasa bo.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kangimini mu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Uto ti bisu a benu, baana ba ngu baa Pfumu hatondo, bisu lafwana ubaafutala matondo huli Nzambi taangu yoosi mu tooni a benu. Benu baa Pfumu hasooli hati a tsomi, mu uyoboho mu isalu hi Livupu li libaava benu bungidi. Benu luuyoboho kaka, mu tooni imiinu hya benu hi hyakangama mu imbuli. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Mu ukuhasa dyaambu mo liina, Nzambi ateele benu mu nzila a Musamu wu Mubwe wu bisu laayabisi benu. Nzambi hateele benu, mana benu liyaka muyusu a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Ni mu buuna, baana ba ngu, telemaani ŋa benu lili na kangamaani mu ndongisili yi bisu laatoosili benu mu munywa, buuve mu muhanda.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Mu hyese hya nde, Nzambi Taata a bisu atondo bisu, na nde ava bisu ibahala hi hyavele na tsukusu na hiitu hi hibwe. Nyaha nde na Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo nde mwakulu, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />baluusa mitima mya benu mu ibahala! Nyaha bava benu kaka mifudi mi ubaavanga ma mabwe taangu yoosi. Na nyaha mambu ma mali mu upala mu minywa mya benu maba mambu ma lisuunga!<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Usambila mu bisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Mu umana, baana ba ngu, baasambilaani mu bisu, mana mambu ma Pfumu matsamuha mu mawasa na bakiinza mo matsyelo makima, we bu bali mu ukiinza mo huli benu. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Baasambilaani kaka mu bisu, mana bisu liyoboho ŋa busu bwa baatu ba nga bukanyi, na mavaanga ma mabi. Mu tooni ati, boosi a bali na imiinu ve. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Ka Pfumu li nga imbuli. Nde sa ahwadisa benu na nde sa akeelese benu ŋa busu bu Muboho. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Bisu lili na hiitu mu Pfumu ti benu lili mu usa, na luukaabwesa ma bisu lili mu utuma benu. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Nyaha Pfumu abaabita mitima mya benu hutsyelo litondo la Nzambi. Nyaha nde abaamweese benu buni benu luuba na mukonono mutso mapasi, we bu Kristo hamweesi ifwaani.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usala mu ifwaani hi iluumbi hya Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Baana baa ngu, mu nduhi a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, livondi benu mu utahuha na pasi nde nga bubolo, buuve nga a mbiili yi yaveleyelemene na ndongisili yi bisu laaviidi bo. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Benu mwakulu liyabi buni benu lafwana uduukala ifwaani hya bisu. Mu tooni ati, bisu a laabeedi babolo ŋa bisu laabeedi huli benu ve. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Bisu a laavondi pasi muutu byudya bi bungodu ve. Ka bisu laakasala, nyangu na butsuhu, hutso ikolili na munyongi, mu uveleva muutu tso mumosi, mupfuna wu ubuungala bisu. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Ka bisu ti laabeedi na muswa wu uvondo benu. Ni ifwaani bisu laatondi umweese benu, mana benu lidukala hyo. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Ni mu buuna, ŋa bisu laabeedi huli benu, bisu laaviidi benu tumili mo yiniiyi: «Woosi wu uveletondo usala, anyaha kaka udya.»<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Ka bisu lili mu uyuha ti bakima ŋa hati la benu, na mbiili yi yavelefwana. Bo bali hutso budwa na bo bali mu ukoto mu misamu mi myaveletala bo. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Huli baatu mo baana, bisu lili mu uvondo na lili mu utuma bo mu nduhi a Pfumu Yisu Kristo ti, bo baafwana ubaasala taangu yoosi mu ubaha byudya. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ka benu, baana ba ngu, hwadaani mu ubaavanga bubwe a likolo ve.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Tso muutu a hasiingili ma bisu lili mu utuma mutso muhanda mo wunuwu ve, tsikahaani nde na a liba likoongo na nde ve, mana nde amono tsonyi. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Ka a livolo nde we muboho a benu ve. Syembaani nde we mwaana a ngu a beno.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Nyaha Pfumu a hyenze nde mwakulu, ava benu hyenze taangu yoosi, we bu nde atoondi! Nyaha Pfumu aba na benu boosi! <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Mu kaka la me Pahuli, me ndi mu upa benu bwehe. Ni mu iliimbu mo hiina, me umbaatala mihanda mya me myosi. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Nyaha Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo asyeme benu boosi!<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>